# Exemplo de configuração local do Media Hub.
# Copie para `.env` e ajuste os valores. Nunca faça commit do `.env`.

# Quando definido, todos os endpoints `/api/v1/*` exigem o header `X-API-Key`
# (ou `Authorization: Bearer <key>`). A UI local recebe a key via cookie HttpOnly.
# Deixe vazio para desenvolvimento aberto em máquina local.
MEDIA_HUB_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Whisper device — dual mode (ADR-006 / ADR-034)
# Choose ONE mode. Default is CPU (safe for laptops / CI / no NVIDIA).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Mode A — CPU (default). Leave DEVICE unset or set cpu.
# Use when: no NVIDIA GPU, Docker without --gpus, first-time self-host.
MEDIA_HUB_WHISPER_DEVICE=cpu
# MEDIA_HUB_WHISPER_COMPUTE_TYPE=int8

# Mode B — CUDA (opt-in). Uncomment and set cuda on NVIDIA hosts.
# Use when: verified `nvidia-smi`, and containers pass GPU (`docker run --gpus all`).
# Keep STT concurrency = 1 per worker.
# If CUDA is unavailable, runtime falls back to CPU with a clear warning (not silent).
# MEDIA_HUB_WHISPER_DEVICE=cuda
# MEDIA_HUB_WHISPER_COMPUTE_TYPE=float16
